This directory holds the bundled Ollama binary distributed inside Kilroy's
NSIS installer. It is populated at build time by `npm run fetch:ollama`
(scripts/fetch-ollama.ps1) which downloads the official Ollama Windows
release and extracts it here.

The directory is checked in EMPTY (just this .gitkeep) so the binary
itself stays out of git history. Production builds depend on the fetch
script being run before `tauri:build`.
